@startuml "Sélection et réservation de billets"

title Sélection et réservation de billets

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

User -> Frontend: Sélectionner événement + billets
Frontend -> API: POST /api/tickets/reserve
note right: Body: {eventId, ticketType, quantity}
API -> Auth: Vérifier token JWT
Auth --> API: user authenticated

API -> TicketSvc: reserveTickets(eventId, ticketType, quantity)
TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT available_tickets WHERE event_id=?
DB --> TicketSvc: available count
alt Billets disponibles
    TicketSvc -> DB: UPDATE tickets SET reserved=true
    DB --> TicketSvc: reservation success
    TicketSvc --> API: reservation data
    API --> Frontend: {reservationId, expiresAt}
    Frontend --> User: Billets réservés (15 min)
else Billets indisponibles
    TicketSvc --> API: error "No tickets available"
    API --> Frontend: 409 Conflict
    Frontend --> User: "Billets non disponibles"
end

@enduml